{"mode":"words","text":"Jika kamu hanya menghafal daftar kosakata, kamu tidak benar-benar belajar bahasa. Di halaman ini, kamu bisa melihat secara langsung bagaimana rasanya berbeda dalam hitungan detik: Teks contoh di atas adalah tampilan aplikasi asli yang bisa kamu rasakan langsung, dan penjelasan ini akan segera dibacakan oleh suara berkualitas penutur asli, sementara kata-katanya menyala bersamaan. Dengan LinguaFlow, kamu belajar bahasa sesuai cara kerja otakmu: pertama memahami, lalu mendengarkan, kemudian berbicara. Metode di baliknya terinspirasi dari Metode Birkenbihl dan terdiri dari empat langkah: mendekode, mendengarkan aktif, mendengarkan pasif, dan berlatih. Cobalah — ketuk sebuah kata di atas.","words":[{"s":0,"e":325},{"s":383,"e":639},{"s":662,"e":894},{"s":940,"e":1347},{"s":1393,"e":1660},{"s":1718,"e":2635},{"s":2844,"e":3088},{"s":3123,"e":3344},{"s":3379,"e":3913},{"s":3994,"e":4307},{"s":4377,"e":5085},{"s":5689,"e":5793},{"s":5851,"e":6235},{"s":6304,"e":6838},{"s":7012,"e":7291},{"s":7361,"e":7558},{"s":7616,"e":7930},{"s":7988,"e":8359},{"s":8406,"e":8824},{"s":8870,"e":9346},{"s":9392,"e":9741},{"s":9787,"e":10193},{"s":10251,"e":10484},{"s":10530,"e":10844},{"s":10878,"e":11447},{"s":11888,"e":12213},{"s":12272,"e":12736},{"s":12771,"e":12864},{"s":12922,"e":13212},{"s":13282,"e":13851},{"s":14025,"e":14582},{"s":14652,"e":15151},{"s":15209,"e":15534},{"s":15580,"e":15696},{"s":15743,"e":15964},{"s":16010,"e":16242},{"s":16289,"e":16649},{"s":16695,"e":17322},{"s":17763,"e":17914},{"s":17972,"e":18506},{"s":18576,"e":18889},{"s":18970,"e":19156},{"s":19214,"e":19493},{"s":19539,"e":20097},{"s":20190,"e":20399},{"s":20433,"e":20770},{"s":20816,"e":21490},{"s":21571,"e":21989},{"s":22047,"e":22744},{"s":23127,"e":23742},{"s":23800,"e":24439},{"s":24485,"e":24799},{"s":24834,"e":25693},{"s":26296,"e":26586},{"s":26621,"e":27585},{"s":27712,"e":27979},{"s":28014,"e":28351},{"s":28421,"e":28769},{"s":28827,"e":29187},{"s":29245,"e":29465},{"s"